WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:03.280
<i>The match between reigning champions Nankatsu</i>

00:03.280 --> 00:09.150
<i>and Toho Academy are headed to extra time with a score of 3-3 in the finals of the National Middle School Football Tournament!</i>

00:09.150 --> 00:12.160
<i>Extra time will consist of two halves of 10 minutes, each.</i>

00:12.160 --> 00:17.280
<i>If the match does not reach a conclusion even after this, both teams will be declared as winners.</i>

00:17.280 --> 00:22.650
<i>Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa Ozora will play in the extra time despite the injuries plaguing his body.</i>

00:22.650 --> 00:24.790
<i>This half will start with Nankatsu's kick-off.</i>

00:24.790 --> 00:29.010
<i>I've relied on the Drive Shot so much in this match.</i>

00:29.010 --> 00:32.370
<i>I've only thought about scoring with the Drive Shot alone.</i>

00:32.370 --> 00:36.550
<i>It shows that I was still overly relying on Roberto.</i>

00:36.550 --> 00:38.390
<i>It's not just Roberto.</i>

00:38.390 --> 00:45.600
<i>Misaki, Wakabayashi, Ishizaki, Nankatsu's Eleven, and Manager...</i>

00:43.640 --> 00:44.600
Fight!

00:44.600 --> 00:45.600
Don't lose!

00:45.600 --> 00:49.360
Fight! Fight! Nankatsu!

00:46.450 --> 00:49.360
<i>I've made it this far thanks to their help.</i>

00:49.360 --> 00:51.600
<i>But after this, I will be alone...</i>

00:51.600 --> 00:56.740
<i>When I depart for Brazil after accomplishing my V3 in this tournament, I will be alone.</i>

00:57.200 --> 00:58.920
<i>Thank you, everyone.</i>

00:58.920 --> 01:00.870
<i>Thank you for everything so far.</i>

01:01.870 --> 01:07.960
<i>I, Tsubasa Ozora—15 years old—will score my last goal in Japan, and depart on my journey.</i>

01:10.220 --> 01:12.930
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:10.220 --> 01:12.930
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:13.850 --> 01:16.520
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:13.850 --> 01:16.520
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:17.430 --> 01:20.140
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:17.430 --> 01:20.140
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:27.030 --> 01:29.860
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

01:27.030 --> 01:29.860
<i>I kept running, lying to myself</i>

01:29.860 --> 01:36.120
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzuketa</i>

01:29.860 --> 01:36.120
<i>that I could live alone, though the loneliness made me burn</i>

01:36.120 --> 01:42.000
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitte ita no ni</i>

01:36.120 --> 01:42.000
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

01:42.000 --> 01:48.590
<i>kokoro made uchinomesareta kono yoru ni</i>

01:42.000 --> 01:48.590
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

01:48.590 --> 01:52.590
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

01:48.590 --> 01:52.590
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

01:52.590 --> 01:57.100
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

01:52.590 --> 01:57.100
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

01:57.100 --> 02:02.690
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

01:57.100 --> 02:02.690
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

02:02.690 --> 02:04.230
<i>baka darou?</i>

02:02.690 --> 02:04.230
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

02:04.230 --> 02:05.440
<i>ai</i>

02:04.230 --> 02:05.440
<i>Love!</i>

02:05.440 --> 02:08.940
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

02:05.440 --> 02:08.940
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

02:08.940 --> 02:18.830
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

02:08.940 --> 02:18.830
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

02:18.830 --> 02:19.660
<i>ai</i>

02:18.830 --> 02:19.660
<i>Love!</i>

02:19.660 --> 02:23.460
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

02:19.660 --> 02:23.460
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

02:23.460 --> 02:27.460
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

02:23.460 --> 02:27.460
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

02:27.460 --> 02:33.720
<i>kono ai mou ichibyou taritomo</i>

02:27.460 --> 02:33.720
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

02:33.720 --> 02:36.550
<i>hanasanai</i>

02:33.720 --> 02:36.550
<i>for a single second!</i>

02:38.260 --> 02:43.260
<b><b>EPISODE 51:
MIRACLE DRIVE SHOT!</b></b>

02:38.410 --> 02:40.390
<i>The extra time kicks off!</i>

02:40.390 --> 02:44.100
<i>Tsubasa dribbles through Toho's side by himself.</i>

02:44.100 --> 02:46.420
Tsubasa should be nearly exhausted.

02:46.420 --> 02:47.850
We will destroy him here!

02:49.730 --> 02:50.730
What?!

02:50.730 --> 02:52.660
<i>Both of them were passed in an instant!</i>

02:52.660 --> 02:55.940
<i>Tsubasa still has strength left in him.</i>

02:55.940 --> 02:57.190
Eat this!

02:57.190 --> 02:59.950
<i>Tsubasa jumps first, dodging them!</i>

03:00.620 --> 03:01.700
Tsubasa!

03:01.700 --> 03:04.670
<i>Tsubasa, are you immortal or what?!</i>

03:04.670 --> 03:07.500
<i>How can you still jump like that?</i>

03:07.500 --> 03:08.910
Tsubasa!

03:08.910 --> 03:10.160
I will take that ball!

03:12.640 --> 03:16.380
<i>Tsubasa firmly blocks the ball with both his legs!</i>

03:18.010 --> 03:20.130
<i>I won't give it back until I score!</i>

03:20.130 --> 03:21.760
<i>I never will!</i>

03:21.760 --> 03:24.140
Stop him! Stop Tsubasa!

03:25.530 --> 03:27.770
<i>Damn, it's starting again.</i>

03:27.770 --> 03:32.850
<i>It looks like my body's really reaching its limit...</i>

03:33.370 --> 03:36.810
<i>But... I must turn this into a goal.</i>

03:36.810 --> 03:39.280
<i>I will score this parting goal!</i>

03:41.850 --> 03:44.230
<i>Awesome! What awesome technique he has!</i>

03:44.230 --> 03:45.240
Tsubasa!

03:45.240 --> 03:46.280
Tsubasa...!

03:46.280 --> 03:47.580
Tsubasa!

03:48.290 --> 03:49.040
<i>It looks similar.</i>

03:49.720 --> 03:55.330
<i>When Tsubasa moved to Nankatsu City, his only friend was the football.</i>

03:55.330 --> 03:56.540
<i>It looks similar...</i>

03:56.540 --> 04:02.510
<i>It's so similar to how he looked when he alone made it past all of Shutetsu with his friend...</i>

04:03.120 --> 04:05.220
Tsubasa!

04:06.100 --> 04:07.760
We will stop him here!

04:08.750 --> 04:14.090
<i>His extraordinary football sense isn't dulled, despite all of his injuries!</i>

04:14.090 --> 04:17.640
<i>He is an all-round player with superior talent!</i>

04:17.640 --> 04:21.610
<i>This is Tsubasa Ozora, the Prodigal Son of Football!</i>

04:22.360 --> 04:26.120
<i>He finally manages to get past all of Toho's defenders.</i>

04:28.000 --> 04:29.100
<i>The goal...</i>

04:29.100 --> 04:30.790
<i>I can see the goal.</i>

04:30.790 --> 04:32.500
<i>I will score this shot for sure!</i>

04:34.000 --> 04:38.000
<i>However, Hyuga's stayed behind, having seen through his intentions!</i>

04:38.000 --> 04:39.310
Here I come, Tsubasa!

04:39.310 --> 04:40.250
Bring it on!

04:41.090 --> 04:43.830
<i>Will Tsubasa shoot, or can Hyuga stop him first?</i>

04:43.830 --> 04:44.800
<i>Which one will it be?</i>

04:46.420 --> 04:49.940
Sliding Tiger Shot!

04:49.940 --> 04:52.540
<i>Hyuga was a split second faster!</i>

04:52.540 --> 04:53.980
<i>Tsubasa can't shoot the ball!</i>

04:55.560 --> 04:56.350
What?!

04:57.280 --> 04:58.610
Tsubasa...

05:00.650 --> 05:03.300
Ishizaki...

05:03.300 --> 05:04.790
I...

05:04.790 --> 05:06.990
We...

05:06.990 --> 05:11.370
Aren't we your friends, Tsubasa?!

05:11.370 --> 05:12.660
He is right, Tsubasa!

05:12.660 --> 05:13.930
You are not alone!

05:13.930 --> 05:15.690
We are right behind you!

05:15.690 --> 05:18.420
Take it, Tsubasa!

05:18.420 --> 05:19.840
<i>Ishizaki...</i>

05:19.840 --> 05:21.130
<i>Guys...</i>

05:21.130 --> 05:23.170
<i>My friends...</i>

05:25.680 --> 05:29.100
<i>I will turn Ishizaki and everyone's pass...</i>

05:30.300 --> 05:31.180
Tsubasa!

05:31.780 --> 05:34.040
<i>They will certainly stay with me...</i>

05:34.040 --> 05:35.180
<i>My friends are with me.</i>

05:35.800 --> 05:37.400
<i>I am not alone!</i>

05:37.400 --> 05:40.820
<i>And when I go to Brazil, I won't be alone!</i>

05:40.820 --> 05:42.730
We're counting on you, Tsubasa!

05:43.690 --> 05:47.240
<i>They are always supporting me from behind!</i>

05:49.200 --> 05:53.450
<i>His preparation for his Drive Shot and the pass are perfectly synced!</i>

05:53.450 --> 05:54.830
I challenge you, Tsubasa!

05:54.830 --> 05:57.870
He isn't using his leg the same way he always does for the Drive Shot.

05:57.870 --> 06:00.920
<i>This is my final shot in Japan!</i>

06:02.710 --> 06:08.680
Here's my farewell goal!

06:08.680 --> 06:09.510
I will stop that!

06:09.510 --> 06:10.890
Even if it's only my right hand...!

06:15.000 --> 06:16.350
<i>It bounces!</i>

06:21.900 --> 06:24.490
<i>It's in!</i>

06:24.490 --> 06:26.600
<i>In the first minute of extra time!</i>

06:26.600 --> 06:30.410
<i>Nankatsu's finally made a comeback with Tsubasa's goal!</i>

06:30.960 --> 06:31.920
I did it!

06:31.920 --> 06:33.830
I scored!

06:33.830 --> 06:34.770
You sure did!

06:34.770 --> 06:36.290
You did it, Tsubasa!

06:36.290 --> 06:39.120
<i>The Nankatsu Eleven are hugging each other in joy!</i>

06:39.120 --> 06:40.680
<i>The score is 4-3.</i>

06:40.680 --> 06:44.880
<i>Nankatsu is leading over Toho for the first time in this match, by one goal.</i>

06:44.880 --> 06:47.590
<i>It was a great shot indeed.</i>

06:47.590 --> 06:52.470
<i>The shot rebounded off the ground and its severe spin sent it hurtling in the opposite direction.</i>

06:52.470 --> 06:54.640
<i>It wound up thrusting into the side net!</i>

06:54.640 --> 06:58.140
<i>This is probably a different application of the Drive Shot.</i>

06:56.330 --> 06:58.140
Tsubasa, you are the best!

06:58.140 --> 07:03.130
<i>A Miracle Drive Shot only Tsubasa could make!</i>

07:04.400 --> 07:08.130
<i>He's scored his 4th goal in this match despite all of his injuries.</i>

07:08.130 --> 07:09.720
<i>He is truly awesome!</i>

07:09.720 --> 07:13.780
<i>This is the football prodigy that Japan's given birth to, Tsubasa Ozora!</i>

07:13.780 --> 07:15.350
You did it, Tsubasa!

07:15.350 --> 07:17.980
We are finally leading by one goal!

07:17.980 --> 07:20.790
We've come one step closer to our dream, right?

07:20.790 --> 07:23.730
To our dream...

07:23.730 --> 07:24.500
Tsubasa?

07:24.500 --> 07:26.120
Tsubasa!

07:26.120 --> 07:27.050
Tsubasa?!

07:27.050 --> 07:29.990
Tsubasa!

07:29.990 --> 07:31.300
Tsubasa!!!

07:38.160 --> 07:40.040
You've opened your eyes, Tsubasa!

07:40.040 --> 07:41.060
Tsubasa!

07:42.850 --> 07:44.310
Where am I?

07:44.310 --> 07:45.850
The infirmary.

07:46.970 --> 07:48.040
What about the match?!

07:48.040 --> 07:48.900
How's Nankatsu?

07:48.900 --> 07:50.780
How are my friends doing?!

07:50.780 --> 07:51.730
Tsubasa.

07:51.730 --> 07:52.920
Tsubasa!

07:52.920 --> 07:54.860
Stay still for a while!

07:54.860 --> 07:56.950
The match is still in extra time.

07:58.370 --> 08:02.370
I've finally collapsed, right?

08:02.760 --> 08:03.780
Yeah.

08:03.780 --> 08:05.630
But you've scored, Tsubasa.

08:05.630 --> 08:06.840
Our comeback goal.

08:06.840 --> 08:10.340
Yeah, that beautiful one last goal.

08:13.890 --> 08:14.840
Tsubasa!

08:14.840 --> 08:16.200
Go for it, Toho!

08:16.200 --> 08:16.850
Attack!

08:16.850 --> 08:17.970
Sorimachi!

08:21.560 --> 08:23.410
<i>Nankatsu are desperately defending!</i>

08:23.410 --> 08:26.560
<i>However, their Captain Tsubasa is not on the field.</i>

08:26.560 --> 08:29.280
Brother, why don't you attack?

08:29.280 --> 08:32.630
You can score if you shoot now.

08:32.630 --> 08:33.950
<i>Kojiro...</i>

08:33.950 --> 08:34.880
Guys...

08:34.880 --> 08:35.950
It's 4-3.

08:35.950 --> 08:36.700
Oh!

08:36.700 --> 08:40.080
Coach, is it still the first half of extra time?

08:40.080 --> 08:41.570
Tsubasa!

08:41.570 --> 08:43.870
Coach! Let me go back in the pitch!

08:43.870 --> 08:44.730
I refuse.

08:44.730 --> 08:45.790
No can do!

08:45.790 --> 08:48.340
Don't tell me someone has been subbed in in my stead?!

08:48.340 --> 08:49.520
It's fine.

08:49.520 --> 08:51.550
We didn't have anyone else enter for you.

08:51.550 --> 08:54.760
They said that they would protect this lead all together.

08:55.390 --> 08:59.600
Tsubasa's collapsed because we burdened him too much.

09:00.040 --> 09:03.140
It doesn't matter if he can come back or not.

09:03.140 --> 09:06.520
We will defend this first half of extra time by ourselves.

09:06.520 --> 09:10.730
We will protect that one goal he gave us as ten people!

09:10.730 --> 09:13.140
We implore you, coach!

09:13.140 --> 09:15.990
They requested that from the coach.

09:16.610 --> 09:17.820
Guys...

09:17.820 --> 09:22.130
However, I cannot allow you to overuse your body anymore.

09:22.130 --> 09:23.000
Huh?!

09:23.000 --> 09:26.210
I am planning to have Yamamori play in the second half.

09:26.620 --> 09:28.760
I thought you made a promise with me, Tsubasa.

09:28.760 --> 09:31.820
You would withdraw from the game immediately should you collapse.

09:31.820 --> 09:33.050
But, doctor...!

09:33.050 --> 09:36.170
Why must you go to such lengths to fight?!

09:36.170 --> 09:39.360
Your real dream is not Nankatsu's V3!

09:39.360 --> 09:43.270
It's supposed to be going Brazil and becoming the best footballer in the world!

09:45.610 --> 09:50.040
It's for the sake of that big dream that I can't afford to lose here.

09:50.040 --> 09:53.610
I need to fight and win.

09:53.610 --> 09:57.360
I will take full responsibility.

09:57.360 --> 10:00.020
I don't care even if I die in this match.

10:00.020 --> 10:03.530
If Tsubasa Ozora is a person that'd be done in here,

10:03.530 --> 10:06.900
then his dreams of Brazil and making Japan #1 in the world

10:06.900 --> 10:09.340
and becoming the best footballer in the world...

10:09.340 --> 10:13.630
None of those dreams would ever become the truth to begin with!

10:15.520 --> 10:17.010
Please, let him play.

10:18.770 --> 10:25.430
Before winning and losing, not being able to play football is the hardest thing for Tsubasa.

10:25.900 --> 10:29.890
Don't take football away from Tsubasa, please...

10:31.610 --> 10:33.150
Manager...

10:36.860 --> 10:38.280
You wish I'd let you shoot!

10:40.420 --> 10:42.420
It was a nice cut, Ishizaki.

10:43.030 --> 10:45.980
Guys, nice defense there.

10:45.980 --> 10:49.330
Guys! I... I will play!

10:49.710 --> 10:51.700
Tsubasa!

10:51.700 --> 10:52.320
It's Tsubasa!

10:52.320 --> 10:58.760
<i>Oh, Tsubasa Ozora who was previously out of the field due to injury has appeared in front of the bench.</i>

10:56.370 --> 10:57.880
Tsubasa is back!

10:57.880 --> 10:58.760
Tsubasa!

11:01.050 --> 11:03.760
<i>The cleared ball goes to Hyuga.</i>

11:03.760 --> 11:04.810
Stop him!

11:04.810 --> 11:07.100
He can easily score with the Tiger Shot from there!

11:07.600 --> 11:08.350
What?!

11:14.570 --> 11:16.570
<i>Hyuga...</i>

11:16.570 --> 11:18.420
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

11:31.620 --> 11:33.140
Hyuga...

11:33.140 --> 11:36.250
He sent the ball out to let Tsubasa back onto the pitch again.

11:36.250 --> 11:39.090
<i>Tsubasa is walking back onto the pitch!</i>

11:39.090 --> 11:40.380
Tsubasa is...!

11:40.380 --> 11:42.340
So you can play, Tsubasa!

11:42.340 --> 11:44.550
We couldn't have this otherwise, y'know!

11:44.550 --> 11:48.850
Tsubasa!

11:48.850 --> 11:52.310
<i>The cheers for Tsubasa ring out like wildfire!</i>

11:52.310 --> 11:53.690
Tsubasa!

11:53.690 --> 11:55.020
Tsubasa!

11:55.020 --> 11:57.020
All right! We won't lose either!

11:57.020 --> 11:57.850
Hyuga!

11:57.850 --> 11:58.660
Hyuga!

11:58.660 --> 11:59.530
Hyuga!

12:02.460 --> 12:04.520
<i>Okay. Let's do this, Hyuga!</i>

12:04.520 --> 12:06.240
<i>Bring it on, Tsubasa!</i>

12:06.240 --> 12:07.900
<i>It's showtime again!</i>

12:07.900 --> 12:10.580
<i>Until the whistle marking the end of this match blows...</i>

12:10.580 --> 12:12.540
<i>...we will keep fighting!</i>

12:13.420 --> 12:15.040
<i>Tsubasa is doing the throw-in.</i>

12:19.380 --> 12:20.130
<i>Tsubasa...!</i>

12:21.010 --> 12:21.510
What?!

12:21.510 --> 12:22.170
Ah?!

12:22.600 --> 12:24.720
<i>Tsubasa sends the ball to Hyuga!</i>

12:24.720 --> 12:27.720
<i>Is this response to what Hyuga did earlier?</i>

12:28.470 --> 12:29.930
<i>Let's go, Hyuga!</i>

12:31.070 --> 12:32.100
Tsubasa...

12:32.820 --> 12:34.940
<i>Even though your body is totally spent,</i>

12:34.940 --> 12:37.110
<i>you still...</i>

12:40.190 --> 12:41.280
Tsubasa!

12:41.280 --> 12:42.280
Let's do this!

12:42.280 --> 12:44.780
We're aiming to win and get our V1!

12:44.780 --> 12:45.740
Yeah!

12:45.740 --> 12:48.410
<i>Hyuga blows through Tsubasa with absolutely no pity!</i>

12:48.410 --> 12:51.040
<i>The Ferocious Tiger dribbles on with ferocity!</i>

12:51.040 --> 12:52.550
We will hold him off, everyone!

12:52.550 --> 12:53.290
Yeah!

12:53.290 --> 12:54.500
<i>Damn it!</i>

12:54.500 --> 12:56.430
<i>Like hell I'd lose...!</i>

12:56.430 --> 12:58.580
<i>Like hell I'll fall here!</i>

12:58.580 --> 13:02.090
<i>I will keep playing until the very end of this match!</i>

13:03.880 --> 13:06.220
<i>Both teams attack and defend desperately!</i>

13:06.890 --> 13:10.600
<i>Oh, the ball is deflected over to Tsubasa, who just returned!</i>

13:10.600 --> 13:11.810
Have a taste of...

13:11.810 --> 13:14.230
...our Sliding Squad!

13:14.730 --> 13:17.690
<i>Tsubasa is blown away once again!</i>

13:17.690 --> 13:20.490
You bastards! How dare you do that to Tsubasa!

13:20.490 --> 13:23.110
<i>A brave play from the hot-blooded Ishizaki!</i>

13:23.110 --> 13:24.740
<i>Nankatsu steals the ball again!</i>

13:25.640 --> 13:29.450
<i>And the ball finds its way to Tsubasa once more!</i>

13:31.650 --> 13:32.750
<i>Let's do this...</i>

13:33.120 --> 13:35.750
Let's go! For Nankatsu's V3!

13:35.750 --> 13:36.500
Yeah!

13:36.500 --> 13:37.750
Come, Tsubasa!

13:37.750 --> 13:41.380
Tsubasa is still leading Nankatsu, even while his body is falling to pieces...

13:41.380 --> 13:43.600
You really are the captain.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.300
You are Captain Tsubasa!

13:53.350 --> 13:54.340
Go!

13:54.340 --> 13:55.600
Have no pity!

13:55.600 --> 13:58.060
For as long as he stands on the pitch, he needs no sympathy!

13:58.060 --> 13:59.040
Crush him!

13:59.040 --> 14:00.610
You just have to crush Tsubasa!

14:00.610 --> 14:02.110
Yeah!

14:02.110 --> 14:04.860
Toho's Sliding Squad is on the move!

14:04.860 --> 14:06.360
Tsubasa, watch out!

14:06.990 --> 14:08.520
<i>He sends a pass!</i>

14:08.520 --> 14:11.990
<i>Tsubasa sends a skillful pass after drawing his opponents in!</i>

14:13.740 --> 14:18.330
<i>He's letting all the markers focus on him to let us move freely.</i>

14:19.210 --> 14:22.280
Don't you let this pass from Tsubasa go to waste!

14:22.280 --> 14:23.170
Yeah!

14:23.170 --> 14:25.090
We won't let you get to Wakashimazu!

14:25.090 --> 14:26.920
I won't let that happen!

14:29.050 --> 14:31.970
<i>This is a perfectly synchronized triangle pass!</i>

14:31.970 --> 14:33.810
We should join them too, Takasugi!

14:33.810 --> 14:35.060
Let's all go on the offensive!

14:35.060 --> 14:35.600
Yeah!

14:35.600 --> 14:36.600
<i>Damn you!</i>

14:36.600 --> 14:38.730
<i>A wise clear from Sawada!</i>

14:38.730 --> 14:42.650
<i>But the ball gets to Ishizaki who's overlapping here!</i>

14:42.650 --> 14:44.020
<i>All right! I'll shoot!</i>

14:44.020 --> 14:45.860
Watch out, Ishizaki!

14:45.860 --> 14:47.280
He's behind you!

14:50.190 --> 14:51.280
<i>This is a nice move!</i>

14:51.280 --> 14:53.580
<i>Ishizaki immediately changes it to a pass!</i>

14:55.830 --> 14:58.790
<i>Wakashimazu's weak point...is here!</i>

14:59.790 --> 15:02.860
<i>Izawa fires off a curved shot, aimed at the right corner of the goal!</i>

15:02.860 --> 15:05.710
<i>This is a Banana Shot that's curving outwards!</i>

15:07.800 --> 15:11.340
<i>If I can't become champion this next tournament, I'll give up football!</i>

15:11.340 --> 15:13.180
<i>Ken Wakashimazu,</i>

15:13.180 --> 15:14.680
<i>a man never goes back on his word!</i>

15:15.140 --> 15:16.770
<i>He caught it!</i>

15:16.770 --> 15:21.770
<i>Even though his body position made it hard, he stopped that shot with a one-hand diving catch!</i>

15:21.770 --> 15:23.270
My shot was...

15:23.270 --> 15:25.190
<i>In spite of his left arm's injury,</i>

15:25.190 --> 15:29.030
<i>he avoided this absolute crisis with only his right hand!</i>

15:29.030 --> 15:31.110
<i>Nankatsu can't score!</i>

15:31.110 --> 15:32.990
That was a perfect attack, yet...

15:33.600 --> 15:35.990
<i>I protected our goal, dad.</i>

15:36.890 --> 15:40.870
<i>The first half of extra time ends with this whistle!</i>

15:43.380 --> 15:44.820
Tsubasa, are you okay?

15:44.820 --> 15:46.300
Tsubasa!

15:46.300 --> 15:47.380
Are you okay?!

15:56.780 --> 15:57.890
Guys...

15:57.890 --> 15:59.640
What is it, Tsubasa?

16:00.320 --> 16:03.270
I... I want to...

16:03.270 --> 16:05.920
I want to play in the second half, too!

16:07.360 --> 16:13.780
But I can't move like I usually do, anymore...

16:13.780 --> 16:16.720
If I'm only bringing all of you down,

16:16.720 --> 16:18.410
I don't mind being subbed out.

16:19.090 --> 16:20.450
Tsubasa...

16:21.100 --> 16:24.810
But I want to play until the very end.

16:24.810 --> 16:27.420
I want to play with you all until the end.

16:30.060 --> 16:31.470
Then just play, Tsubasa!

16:32.800 --> 16:35.580
Let's fight together in the second half too, Tsubasa!

16:35.580 --> 16:36.880
We have all come this far.

16:36.880 --> 16:38.970
We will stick together until the end!

16:40.170 --> 16:41.980
Guys...

16:41.980 --> 16:43.460
Are you really fine with that?

16:43.460 --> 16:45.310
It's okay if I play, despite the state I'm in?

16:45.310 --> 16:46.860
You bet it is!

16:47.500 --> 16:50.520
You are our Captain!

16:50.520 --> 16:52.150
Guys...

16:53.800 --> 17:00.120
Mommy, when Tsubasa Ozora wasn't in play, my bro didn't even fire a single shot, right?

17:00.120 --> 17:01.620
But that's fine.

17:01.620 --> 17:05.620
Kojiro has always had his mind set on defeating Tsubasa.

17:05.620 --> 17:08.300
Tsubasa, if you play any longer...

17:08.300 --> 17:11.370
Still, I'm sure that Tsubasa will play in the second half.

17:11.370 --> 17:15.130
Yes. He will keep on playing his way until the end.

17:15.770 --> 17:17.090
A one-goal lead...

17:17.090 --> 17:21.010
If we can keep this, Nankatsu will win!

17:21.010 --> 17:24.270
I'm sure that Hyuga will catch up with them and make an upset!

17:24.270 --> 17:30.150
At this rate, Toho Academy's dream of a triple crown with middle school, high school and university wins...

17:30.150 --> 17:35.760
Mr. Principal, I already feel satisfied by how much they have fought so far in this final match.

17:36.280 --> 17:41.790
No matter the result, I am proud of these students.

17:41.790 --> 17:43.790
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL - SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

17:42.880 --> 17:45.790
All right, let's go with Tsubasa's plan.

17:46.600 --> 17:47.790
Yeah.

17:47.790 --> 17:50.790
We're already come this far. I have nothing more to say.

17:50.790 --> 17:53.800
So as not to have any regrets, play with all you've got.

17:53.800 --> 17:55.130
Yes!

17:56.180 --> 17:57.510
Hyuga.

17:58.590 --> 18:03.100
The moment I let you play, I left this match in your hands.

18:05.020 --> 18:06.230
I'm counting on you.

18:07.600 --> 18:08.770
Yes, sir!

18:08.770 --> 18:12.520
<i>The last 10 minutes of the game... The second half of extra time starts now.</i>

18:12.520 --> 18:15.070
We're counting on you, Hyuga! Toho!

18:15.070 --> 18:17.490
<i>The second half starts with Toho's kick-off.</i>

18:19.200 --> 18:21.580
Tsubasa's in front of the goal?!

18:21.950 --> 18:25.460
That's... That's the tactic of using Tsubasa as a defense player.

18:25.460 --> 18:27.370
That's how Nankatsu beat Shutetsu!

18:27.370 --> 18:28.910
<i>Bring it on, Hyuga!</i>

18:28.910 --> 18:31.540
<i>I won't lose... I won't lose, in terms of fighting spirit!</i>

18:31.540 --> 18:34.250
Tsubasa is in the defense...

18:34.250 --> 18:36.320
<i>Thank you, Tsubasa.</i>

18:36.320 --> 18:38.590
<i>This makes it easier for me to play.</i>

18:39.720 --> 18:43.390
<i>Hyuga instantly gets in position to shoot!</i>

18:43.390 --> 18:44.890
It's a Tiger Shot!

18:46.020 --> 18:46.850
Stop him!

18:46.850 --> 18:48.770
Just throw yourselves in front of it!

18:49.250 --> 18:49.770
Yeah!

18:50.930 --> 18:51.650
What?!

18:51.650 --> 18:54.070
Was that shot a feint?

18:54.070 --> 18:55.460
Come on, Tsubasa!

18:55.460 --> 18:57.320
I will start by catching up with you!

18:57.820 --> 18:59.780
Eat this!

18:59.780 --> 19:03.160
Tiger Shot!

19:03.160 --> 19:04.490
<i>Don't lose.</i>

19:05.700 --> 19:07.070
<i>Don't lose.</i>

19:07.070 --> 19:08.620
<i>Don't you lose, Tsubasa!</i>

19:10.460 --> 19:13.960
My name is Tsubasa Ozora!

19:14.840 --> 19:16.130
<i>He stopped it!</i>

19:16.130 --> 19:18.800
<i>Tsubasa repelled the Tiger Shot!</i>

19:18.800 --> 19:19.720
Tsubasa!

19:22.280 --> 19:23.350
Tsubasa!

19:27.020 --> 19:29.380
<i>That is the man I aim to catch...</i>

19:29.380 --> 19:31.270
<i>Tsubasa Ozora...</i>

19:31.960 --> 19:34.190
<i>I will defeat you!</i>

19:34.190 --> 19:36.030
Are you all right, Tsubasa?

19:34.190 --> 19:36.940
<i>I don't care if you're injured right now.</i>

19:37.440 --> 19:41.490
I've had enough of losing to you!

19:46.950 --> 19:48.120
What!?

19:48.120 --> 19:51.420
<i>I will protect Nankatsu's goal!</i>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.170
<i>Together with Tsubasa!</i>

19:54.540 --> 19:55.880
These guys...

19:56.280 --> 19:57.820
All right! Now we attack!

19:57.820 --> 20:01.220
<i>If we go on the offensive, we can ease Tsubasa's burden!</i>

20:01.220 --> 20:02.330
We will defend!

20:02.330 --> 20:04.590
We won't let you score another goal anymore!

20:05.290 --> 20:07.700
<i>A fierce display of attack and defense in the midfield!</i>

20:07.700 --> 20:08.930
<i>Who will get the ball?</i>

20:10.060 --> 20:11.300
Here!

20:11.300 --> 20:15.940
<i>The one who tipped the scales in this melee is none other than the goalkeeper of Toho, Wakashimazu!</i>

20:15.940 --> 20:17.020
Captain!

20:19.030 --> 20:20.850
Captain, our victory!

20:20.850 --> 20:23.990
Did we not vow to become the champions?

20:24.630 --> 20:26.030
Wakashimazu...

20:28.540 --> 20:30.320
Come on, everyone!

20:30.320 --> 20:31.040
Yeah!

20:31.040 --> 20:32.130
Tsubasa!

20:32.130 --> 20:34.540
Are you daunted because of that shot?

20:34.540 --> 20:35.830
The ball is your friend.

20:35.830 --> 20:39.710
The one who taught me that was you, right, Tsubasa?

20:39.710 --> 20:43.010
Let's protect Nankatsu's goal together, Tsubasa!

20:43.010 --> 20:44.130
Until the end!

20:45.590 --> 20:47.050
Morisaki...

20:47.050 --> 20:50.560
There's no one else but me who can help Hyuga!

20:50.560 --> 20:51.980
Hyuga!

20:51.980 --> 20:53.060
He's gonna shoot!

20:53.060 --> 20:53.730
Stop him!

20:53.730 --> 20:54.980
We should stop him!

20:54.980 --> 20:57.160
<i>No matter how amazing your Tiger Shot is,</i>

20:57.160 --> 20:59.820
<i>you won't score if you just shoot away recklessly, Hyuga!</i>

21:00.210 --> 21:01.760
<i>Don't panic, Kojiro!</i>

21:01.760 --> 21:03.110
<i>Heed carefully!</i>

21:03.110 --> 21:06.030
<i>Toho winning against Nankatsu...</i>

21:06.030 --> 21:08.910
<i>It means me winning against Tsubasa!</i>

21:09.620 --> 21:10.870
What?!

21:10.870 --> 21:11.990
Hyuga!

21:11.990 --> 21:13.210
That's it, Kojiro!

21:14.500 --> 21:16.580
<i>The ball gets to the unmarked Sorimachi!</i>

21:16.580 --> 21:18.790
<i>This is a decisive chance for Toho!</i>

21:23.140 --> 21:25.680
<i>A fine save by the goalkeeper Morisaki!</i>

21:25.680 --> 21:27.220
<i>I protected our goal, Tsubasa!</i>

21:27.220 --> 21:30.890
<i>However, Sawada is right on this ball!</i>

21:30.890 --> 21:32.020
Oh no!

21:32.020 --> 21:33.270
Here it is!

21:34.770 --> 21:37.140
<i>Nankatsu stops them, again!</i>

21:37.140 --> 21:40.300
<i>Tsubasa takes this shot in the face and protects their goal!</i>

21:40.300 --> 21:42.240
<i>The ball is my friend...</i>

21:42.240 --> 21:43.530
<i>I'm not afraid!</i>

21:44.920 --> 21:46.240
<i>Why?</i>

21:46.240 --> 21:47.560
<i>Why is it?</i>

21:47.560 --> 21:49.970
<i>Why can't we win?</i>

21:50.700 --> 21:52.200
Tsubasa!

21:52.630 --> 21:53.800
No...

21:53.800 --> 21:55.800
I can't bear this anymore...

21:55.800 --> 21:56.960
Sanae?

21:56.960 --> 21:58.240
Stop!

21:58.240 --> 22:01.210
Don't hurt Tsubasa anymore!

22:02.410 --> 22:07.180
<i>Even though he's this beaten up and torn to pieces, why?</i>

22:07.180 --> 22:10.590
<i>What on Earth is making you go this far?</i>

22:10.590 --> 22:11.550
<i>Is it your dream?</i>

22:11.550 --> 22:13.170
<i>Friendship?</i>

22:13.170 --> 22:17.870
<i>And why can't I beat you even in this state, Tsubasa?</i>

22:38.700 --> 22:44.750
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.700 --> 22:44.750
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.750 --> 22:50.750
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.750 --> 22:50.750
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.750 --> 22:56.800
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.750 --> 22:56.800
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.800 --> 23:01.430
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.800 --> 23:01.430
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.060 --> 23:07.730
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.060 --> 23:07.730
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.060 --> 23:15.150
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.060 --> 23:15.150
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.150 --> 23:21.200
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.200 --> 23:25.660
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.200 --> 23:25.660
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:26.960 --> 23:33.300
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:26.960 --> 23:33.300
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.300 --> 23:39.340
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.340 --> 23:45.640
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.340 --> 23:45.640
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.900 --> 23:59.970
COMING UP, EPISODE 52:
ENDLESS DREAM
